 "nl": [
  "Restrict ntp-servers so that its only permitted destinations are ops on NTP (UDP 123); dns-servers on NTP (UDP 123); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Deny all traffic from mail to dns-servers (this overrides any public service).",
  "cameras is isolated: it may only reach ops on syslog (UDP 514), and nothing else.",
  "Hosts in voip may reach ntp-servers over SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "Block RDP (TCP 3389), FTP (TCP 21), Telnet (TCP 23) from dns-servers to cameras; the rest of any TCP port between them is allowed.",
  "Apart from dns-servers on NTP (UDP 123), all traffic originating in mail must be dropped.",
  "Apart from dns-servers on DNS over UDP 53, all traffic originating in ops must be dropped.",
  "Allow ntp-servers to connect to cameras using SSH (TCP 22) and SMTP (TCP 25) and syslog (UDP 514)."
 ],
